From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: devboule-bot <devboule-bot@devboule.invalid>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] local env hardening on top of 0003

Local follow-up to 0003, not upstream. Removes logged registry values
from the trace lines (names only), rejects a bare "=" key that cannot
form a valid record, and widens reg_value_to_string and
environment_block to pub so the daemon-side regression test can assert
the filter through the crate our spawns link. A malformed entry is
dropped silently at spawn: the vendored crate has no log sink in a
Devboule build, so a visible notice waits for the daemon log sink.

Local base: vendored portable-pty 0.9.0 + 0003
Applies on top of 0003 with: patch -p1 (from the repository root)
---
diff --git a/vendor/portable-pty/src/cmdbuilder.rs b/vendor/portable-pty/src/cmdbuilder.rs
index 22c10c4f1f59d57b4a2b0de9d9623308f38c1f89..af8c07cf057234f6b3fea6b03ffb067554c2f57c 100644
--- a/vendor/portable-pty/src/cmdbuilder.rs
+++ b/vendor/portable-pty/src/cmdbuilder.rs
@@ -72,7 +72,8 @@
 }
 
